  "Line": {
    "DefaultText": "You feel false, because you are. Did the void not tell you that?\n\n\nNow accept your falseness, even if it hurts, and you will become real.\n\n\nEmbrace your ugliness, your evil, your deformity and let go.\n\nBe you, so I can finally be.",
    "Text": "你感到虚假，因为你就是如此。虚空没有告诉你吗？\\n\\n\\n现在接受你的虚假，即使它会让你痛苦，你也会变得真实。\\n\\n\\n拥抱你的丑陋、邪恶、畸形，让它成为过去式。\\n\\n做你自己，这样我才能最终存在。",
    "zh": "你感到虚假，因为你就是如此。虚空没有告诉你吗？\\n\\n\\n现在接受你的虚假，即使它会让你痛苦，你也会变得真实。\\n\\n\\n拥抱你的丑陋、邪恶、畸形，让它成为过去式。\\n\\n做你自己，这样我才能最终存在。",
    "en": "You feel false, because you are. Did the void not tell you that?\\n\\n\\nNow accept your falseness, even if it hurts, and you will become real.\\n\\n\\nEmbrace your ugliness, your evil, your deformity and let go.\\n\\nBe you, so I can finally be.",
    "ja": "You feel false, because you are. Did the void not tell you that?\n\n\nNow accept your falseness, even if it hurts, and you will become real.\n\n\nEmbrace your ugliness, your evil, your deformity and let go.\n\nBe you, so I can finally be."
  },
